            "value": [
              "Interviews guided by questionnaires. Per outsourcing case stakeholders on the side of the outsourcer as well as from the side of the service supplier have been interviewed. Stakeholders were selected from three levels in the organizations: strategic, tactical and operational. Often also advisers to the deal have been interviewed."
